<title>USA: Kellogg sees trouble matching year-ago Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Kellogg sees trouble matching year-ago Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kellogg Co said Friday it will be difficult in the first quarter of 1997 to match year-ago earnings.</p>
<p>The cereal giant earned $0.99 in the 1996 first quarter before charges.  &quot;It's a challenging comparison,&quot; Kellogg spokesman Richard Lovell said.  </p>
<p>&quot;We did indicate that (the $0.99 a share earned in first quarter 1996) is optimistic for next year,&quot; Lovell added.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
